sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Producteur
    participant R as RabbitMQ
    participant A as Administration
    participant N as Notification
    P->>R: publish persistant + confirm
    R-->>P: confirm
    R->>A: livraison
    A-->>R: ack manuel
    R->>N: livraison indépendante
    N-->>R: ack manuel

